<div class="legal-page-container">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="legal-title">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <div class="legal-content">
      <p>At Seravolve, we are pleased to offer <strong>Free Delivery</strong> on all orders, with no minimum purchase required.</p>
      <h2>Processing Time</h2>
      <p>All orders are processed within 1-2 business days. Orders are not shipped or delivered on weekends or holidays.</p>
      <h2>Shipping Rates & Delivery Estimates</h2>
      <p>Shipping charges for your order will be free. Delivery delays can occasionally occur, but we strive to ensure your products arrive as quickly as possible.</p>
      <h2>Shipment Confirmation & Order Tracking</h2>
      <p>You will receive a Shipment Confirmation email once your order has shipped containing your tracking number(s).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .legal-page-container { padding: 80px 0; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .legal-title { font-size: 2.5rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; font-family: var(--font-heading); color: #0A1E30; }
  .legal-content h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; color: #0A1E30; }
  .legal-content p { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .legal-content ul { padding-left: 20px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .legal-content li { margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.6; }
</style>

